[center][size=6][color=#93c47d][b]CSS v1.0.7[/b][/color][/size][/center]

[list]
[*]New Body preset row in Customize > Body. Left/right switches presets, and it says Custom once you move a slider.
[*]The Template row only has palettes and combos now.
[*]Outfits keep their textures on older or non-Steam game versions. Eve, Commander White, Genessa and Profane Proxima used to go gray there.
[*]New setting: Misc > Compatibility > Outfit materials (Auto, Always game shaders, Off). Leave it on Auto.
[*]CSS.log now shows your game version and the version of each outfit.
[/list]

[b]Still gray?[/b]
Update the outfit, set Outfit materials to Always game shaders, then send me your CSS.log (ue4ss/Mods/CustomShellSystem/CSS.log).

Requires CSS Shared Assets 1.0.7.
